#. i18n: file: kcmodule/capabilitiesPage.ui:239
#. i18n: ectx: property (whatsThis), widget (QLabel, label_4)
#: rc.cpp:306
msgid ""
"If this is enabled, PowerDevil will be able to configure power management "
"for your monitor"
msgstr ""
"Heke ev bê çalak kirin, PowerDevil dê bikare rêveberiya hêzê ji bo dîmendera "
"we veava bike"

#. i18n: file: kcmodule/capabilitiesPage.ui:242
#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QLabel, label_4)
#: rc.cpp:309
msgid "DPMS Support"
msgstr "Piştgirî ya DPMS"

#. i18n: file: kcmodule/capabilitiesPage.ui:256
#. i18n: ectx: property (toolTip), widget (QLabel, label_5)
#: rc.cpp:312
msgid "Support for XTest extension"
msgstr "Piştgirî ji bo dirêjahî ya XTest"

#. i18n: file: kcmodule/capabilitiesPage.ui:259
#. i18n: ectx: property (whatsThis), widget (QLabel, label_5)
#: rc.cpp:315
msgid ""
"Through XTest, PowerDevil is able to fake user activity, preventing "
"suspension loops. If it is not available, loops might occur"
msgstr ""
"Di XTest de, PowerDevil dikare çalakiya bikarhêner bixapîne, bi parastina "
"girêk bûna sekinandinê re. Heke ev tune be, girêk dê çêbin"

#. i18n: file: kcmodule/capabilitiesPage.ui:262
#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QLabel, label_5)
#: rc.cpp:318
msgid "XTest Support"
msgstr "Piştgirî ya XTest"

